OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry with sunny spells
OL,6,Fand light winds to start. Cloud
OL,7,Fthickens from the southwest through
OL,8,Fthe day, bringing outbreaks of mainly
OL,9,Flight rain into Wales and southwest
OL,10,FEngland. Feeling warmer in the
OL,11,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud and rain edge northeast
OL,14,Fovernight, some heavy bursts and
OL,15,Fstronger winds mixed in. A much milder
OL,16,Fnight than recently, becoming very
OL,17,Fmild in the southwest by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
