OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloud, drizzle and outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain move slowly east through the
OL,7,Fday, with extensive low cloud. Breezy
OL,8,Fand generally mild, while heavier rain
OL,9,Freaches the northwest later.
